==Changes==
* The [[Getting_the_current_interface_number|TOC version]] is <code>11303</code>
* Added the [[Keyring]] feature.
* Restricted {{api|SendChatMessage}}() to require hardware events.
* Removed the "CHANNEL" chat type from {{api|SendAddonMessage}}() and added "SAY" and "YELL" types. <ref>{{ref web|url=https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/classic-patch-1-13-3-lua-api-change|author=[[Kaivax]]|date=2019-12-09|title=Classic Patch 1.13.3 Lua API Change}}</ref>
* {{api|UnitHealth}}() and {{api|UnitHealthMax}}() return health values for NPCs again instead of percentages (hotfixed). <ref>{{ref web|url=https://us.forums.blizzard.com/en/wow/t/wow-classic-ui-api-change-for-unithealth/446596|author=Kaivax|date=2020-02-18|title=WoW Classic UI API Change for UnitHealth}}</ref>

